  "published": "2026-10-05T08:52:07.433Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.3.2: on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.3.2 + SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.1. An app that references SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.0 directly gets NU1605 (downgrade): move it to 3.0.1. Video Depth Anything streaming (VideoDepthAnythingStream, driven by DepthEstimationPipeline). FP32 models with FP16-STORED weights load at full speed (the weight Cast is folded at load), and WeightStorage.Half keeps FP32 weights as FP16 on the device (also in a browser). InferenceSession.SkipCompletionWait submits a run without awaiting it (WebGPU). Fewer dispatches per forward (GELU and GroupNorm fusion, size-1 Transposes as reshapes, fused reversed Slices); less host work per node. Blazor AOT: a shape-inference fallback no longer runs the rest of graph compile in the interpreter. Fixes: an adopted If output leaked a buffer per forward; session Dispose releases operator scratch; MatMul batch broadcasting; Concat folds a known-empty input. See CHANGELOG.md.",
